!$lang = "en"
!$all = {"en":{"title_001":"Decoder-only Transformer (Llama-style): Generation / Inference Flow","source_001":"Source: https://github.com/chronicqazxc/transformer-architecture-uml","act_001":"Tokens","act_002":"Embedding","note_001":"    [-0.251, 0.901, 0.464, 0.197] (embedding_cat)\n    [-0.688, -0.688, -0.884, 0.732] (embedding_on)\n    [0.202, 0.416, -0.959, 0.940] (embedding_desk)\n    * Let's say it is Matrix X\n    * 1st pass (Prefill): the whole prompt [\"cat\", \"on\", \"desk\"] is embedded\n      and processed in parallel.\n    * Later passes (Decode): only the newly generated token is embedded;\n      the earlier tokens' K and V are reused from the KV cache.","cond_001":"All N layers (transformer blocks) done?","cond_002":"No","act_003":"RMSNorm (pre-attention)","note_002":"    Pre-norm (Llama-style): normalize the layer input BEFORE attention.\n    * The un-normalized input is kept aside as the residual stream.\n    * RMSNorm = x / sqrt(mean(x^2) + eps) x learned scale (gamma) (no mean-centering, no bias).\n\n    Why normalize before attention?\n    * Every layer ADDS its attention output back onto the residual stream, so the stream's scale keeps growing with depth (100, 100.5, ...).\n    * A large input makes Q x K^T huge: softmax saturates (outputs near 0 or 1), its gradient goes to ~0 and training becomes unstable (exploding / vanishing gradients).\n    * RMSNorm resets a COPY of the stream to a standard scale, so attention always sees a safe input and its output stays small and stable.\n    * Only the copy is normalized; the residual stream itself stays untouched, so gradients flow straight through the \"+\" back to the early layers (pre-norm, unlike the original post-norm Transformer: no fragile warm-up needed).\n    * RMSNorm skips the mean subtraction of LayerNorm: same stability, cheaper.","part_001":"Multi-Head Attention","part_002":"Q K V Projection and RoPE","part_003":"Semantic Generation","act_004":"Raw K matrix = X x W_K","act_005":"Raw Q matrix = X x W_Q","act_006":"Value V = X x W_V","note_003":"          Linear Projection (Matrix Multiplication): X x W_Q, X x W_K, X x W_V (toy values below are assumed).\n          Q (Query) = what a token is looking for. K (Key) = the label it offers.\n          V (Value) = the content it passes on when picked.\n          Q and K decide WHO to listen to; V is WHAT gets taken in.\n          Toy setup (terms used below):\n          |= Term |= Meaning |= Toy (head 1 shown) |= Llama 3 8B |\n          | d_model | length of one token's vector | 4 | 4096 |\n          | n_heads | parallel attention heads (each with its own W_Q, W_K, W_V; their Z are concatenated back to d_model) | 2 (head 1 worked out; head 2 is drawn, not computed) | 32 |\n          | d_k = d_head = d_model / n_heads | length of one Q, K or V row, per head | 4 / 2 = 2 (V rows too: d_v = d_k) | 4096 / 32 = 128 |","part_004":"Geometric Rotation","act_007":"Final Q_cat = Raw Q_cat x R_position 0","act_008":"Final K_cat = Raw K_cat x R_position 0","act_009":"Final Q_on = Raw Q_on x R_position 1","act_010":"Final K_on = Raw K_on x R_position 1","act_011":"...","note_004":"          Right now, the Raw Q and Raw K matrices only contain semantic information—they\n          have no concept of sequence order yet. This is the exact moment RoPE\n          (Rotary Position Embedding) steps in to finish generating them.\n          RoPE rotates only Q and K (never V).\n          Toy rotation here (d_k = 2, so one dim pair): (0, 1) turns 90° per position.\n          90°: [a, b] -> [-b, a].  180°: [a, b] -> [-a, -b].\n          (Real RoPE rotates every dim pair of the head, each at its own frequency.)\n          The final K and V are appended to the KV cache, so during Decode\n          only the new token's Q, K, V are computed.","part_005":"The Dot Product","act_012":"Raw score cat = [q_cat x k_cat, q_cat x k_on, q_cat x k_desk]","act_013":"Raw score on = [q_on x k_cat, q_on x k_on, q_on x k_desk]","act_014":"Raw score desk = [q_desk x k_cat, q_desk x k_on, q_desk x k_desk]","note_005":"        Purpose: score how relevant each token's Key is to this token's Query\n        (\"how much should token i look at token j?\"). Dot product q x k: multiply\n        element by element, then add up (sums in the Raw score boxes above).\n        Large = same direction (key matches the query), near 0 = unrelated.\n        The GPU scores all pairs at once, Q x K^T: [3, 2] x [2, 3] = a 3 × 3 grid (row i, column j),\n        each cell = 2 multiply-adds (d_k = 2). Raw scores, not weights yet:\n        [4.0, 3.0, -1.0]  <- Raw score cat\n        [3.0, 1.0, 0.0]  <- Raw score on\n        [2.0, 4.0, -2.0]  <- Raw score desk\n        \"cat\" scores highest with itself. \"on\" aligns most with \"cat\".\n        \"desk\" aligns most with \"on\", and also with \"cat\".\n\n        During Decode only the last row is computed: the new token's query\n        against all cached keys (1 x seq_len scores).","act_015":"Scaling (div sqrt d_k)","note_006":"      To keep the numbers from exploding and blinding the Softmax layer, the entire grid is divided by sqrt d_k.\n      Why: each score is a sum of d_k products, so it grows with d_k; dividing by sqrt d_k keeps the scale steady.\n      Here d_k = 2 (the length of one Q or K row; see the table in the Linear Projection note), so sqrt d_k = sqrt 2 = 1.41.\n      The GPU divides every single cell in our matrix by 1.41\n\n      [4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, 3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, -1.0 / 1.41 = -0.71]\n      [3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, 1.0 / 1.41 = 0.71, 0.0 / 1.41 = 0.0]\n      [2.0 / 1.41 = 1.41, 4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, -2.0 / 1.41 = -1.41]","act_016":"Causal Mask (The Filter Rule)","note_007":"      This is the exact sub-step where the Causal Mask strikes.\n      The system compares the Position ID of the Query (the row)\n      against the Position ID of the Key (the column).\n      The Rule: If Key Position > Query Position,\n      it is a future token. Replace the score with negative infinity (-∞).\n\n      [2.83, -∞, -∞]\n      [2.12, 0.71, -∞]\n      [1.41, 2.83, -1.41]","act_017":"The Softmax Magnification (The Percentage Generation)","note_008":"      When this masked grid is fed into Softmax,\n      the math handles the rows beautifully: Row 0 (\"cat\"): Because e^-∞ = 0,\n      the future slots get an absolute 0% weight. \"cat\" is forced to look at itself 100%.\n      Row 1 (\"on\"): The future slot for \"desk\" gets 0%. The remaining scores (2.12 and 0.71) compete,\n      resulting in about 80% cat and 20% on (e^2.12 = 8.33, e^0.71 = 2.03, 8.33 / 10.37 = 0.80).\n      Row 2 (\"desk\"): No values were blocked.\n      The scaled scores (1.41, 2.83, -1.41) compete openly, resulting in about\n      19% cat, 80% on, and 1% desk (e^1.41 = 4.10, e^2.83 = 16.95, e^-1.41 = 0.24, over their sum 21.29).","act_018":"Attention Map Matrix","note_009":"      [100% (1.0), 0% (0.0), 0% (0.0)]\n      [80% (0.8), 20% (0.2), 0% (0.0)]\n      [19% (0.19), 80% (0.8), 1% (0.01)]","act_019":"Value Matrix Multiplication (The Mixing)","note_010":"      In this step, the model takes the Attention Map Matrix and multiplies it by the Value Matrix (V).\n      This is where tokens actually exchange information: each token's output Z is a weighted sum of the Value vectors of the tokens it attends to (e.g. \"on\" = 80% of cat's V + 20% of its own).\n\n      Context Matrix (Z)=Attention_Map x V\n\n      To see this mathematically, let’s work out head 1 and assume each word's Value vector has d_head = 2 numbers, the same length as Q and K (in real models like Llama 3, d_head is typically 128 numbers per head).\n      Let's assign some realistic semantic numbers to our Value vectors:\n      V_cat = [2.0, -1.0]\n      V_on = [0.0, 3.0]\n      V_desk = [5.0, 1.0]\n\n      The GPU multiplies the weights from each row of the Attention Map against the Value columns.\n      This is a standard weighted sum performed for each row simultaneously in parallel:","note_011":"        z_cat = (1.0 x [2.0, -1.0]) + (0.0 x [0.0, 3.0]) + (0.0 x [5.0, 1.0])","act_020":"z_cat = [2.0, -1.0]","note_012":"        z_on = (0.8 x [2.0, -1.0]) + (0.2 x [0.0, 3.0]) + (0.0 x [5.0, 1.0])\n        z_on = [1.6, -0.8] + [0.0, 0.6]","act_021":"z_on = [1.6, -0.2]","note_013":"        z_desk = (0.19 x [2.0, -1.0]) + (0.8 x [0.0, 3.0]) + (0.01 x [5.0, 1.0])\n        z_desk = [0.38, -0.19] + [0.0, 2.4] + [0.05, 0.01]","act_022":"z_desk = [0.43, 2.22]","note_014":"      Context Matrix (Z) = [\n        Slot 0: [2.0, -1.0]    (Context vector for \"cat\")\n        Slot 1: [1.6, -0.2]    (Context vector for \"on\")\n        Slot 2: [0.43, 2.22]  (Context vector for \"desk\")\n      ]","act_023":"Attention for head 2","act_025":"Linear Projection (W_O)","note_015":"    Linear Projection\n    Blends all the parallel attention heads together\n    * A learned projection layer made of trainable parameters (weights)\n    * It changes the internal numbers and values inside the vectors to\n    blend the context of different heads together.\n    * Matrix Multiplication (×)\n    1. Before W_O (The Split Insights): Each of the N heads (2 in the toy, 32 in Llama 3 8B) looks at\n      the sentence from a different logical angle.\n      * Head 1 outputs a small vector representing grammatical structure.\n      * Head 2 outputs a small vector representing animal traits.\n\n    2. The Concatenation Step: The model glues these N separate vectors together\n      side-by-side to create one ultra-wide vector. At this exact moment,\n      the values are still just raw, isolated pieces of information.\n      They haven't been combined yet.\n\n    3. The W_O Multiplication (×): This wide vector is multiplied by the W_O matrix.\n\n    For \"on\" (the walkthrough above worked out head 1; head 2 and W_O are assumed values):\n    Output = Concat_Z x W_O   ([3, 4] x [4, 4] -> [3, 4], W_O assumed; real: [d_model, d_model])\n    Head 1 Z_on = [1.6, -0.2]   Head 2 Z_on = [1.0, 0.5]\n    Concatenated = [1.6, -0.2, 1.0, 0.5]   (2 + 2 = d_model = 4)\n    Column 0 of W_O = [0.5, -0.2, 0.4, 1.0]\n    Output[0] = 1.6x0.5 + (-0.2)x(-0.2) + 1.0x0.4 + 0.5x1.0\n              = 0.8 + 0.04 + 0.4 + 0.5 = 1.74\n    Head 1 gives 0.84 + head 2 gives 0.9: one number already mixes both heads.\n    All 4 columns: attention output for \"on\" = [1.74, -0.6, 0.17, 0.78]","act_026":"Residual Connection","note_016":"    Adds the layer input (the residual stream saved before the pre-attention RMSNorm)\n    to the attention output, to prevent data loss\n\n    Toy example for \"on\" in layer 1 (all values from above):\n    Layer input (embedding_on)  = [-0.688, -0.688, -0.884, 0.732]\n    Attention output for \"on\"   = [1.74, -0.6, 0.17, 0.78]\n    Sum (element by element)    = [1.052, -1.288, -0.714, 1.512]\n    The original embedding stays inside the sum: the layer only learns the change.","act_027":"RMSNorm (pre-FFN)","note_017":"    Pre-norm: normalize BEFORE the FFN. The un-normalized stream\n    (after the residual above) is kept aside for the next residual add.\n\n    This is a second, separate RMSNorm (same formula, its own gamma).\n    * Its input is x1 = x0 + attention output, the residual result above.\n      That add made the stream's scale bigger again.\n    * The FFN's SwiGLU activation is sensitive to input scale, so x1 is\n      normalized (a copy only) before it enters the FFN.","part_006":"Feed-Forward Network","note_018":"        Purpose: attention moves information between\n        tokens; the FFN processes each token's vector\n        on its own (adds non-linearity).\n        How: expand (gate, up), SiLU gate filters,\n        multiply with up, W_down compresses to d_model.","act_028":"Incoming token vector","note_019":"        The model takes your token vector\n        (e.g., size 4,096) and multiplies it by two separate\n        weight matrices to project it into a much larger\n        hidden dimension—typically about 2.7 to 3.5 times wider\n        (e.g., Llama 3 8B expands 4,096 to 14,336 numbers = 3.5x;\n        a small model may use 8/3 = 2.67x).","act_029":"W_gate","act_030":"Vector A (before)","act_031":"Activation function","note_020":"            SiLU(x) = x · sigmoid(x)  (SwiGLU, as in Llama; some models use GELU instead)\n            * Large negative values -> pushed close to 0 (almost OFF)\n            * Large positive values -> pass through almost unchanged (ON)","act_032":"Vector A (after)","act_033":"W_up","act_034":"Vector B","act_035":"Combine","note_021":"        Element-wise multiplication\n        [ 12.5, -0.072, 0.110 ]\n        (Activated Vector A / The Filter)\n        × [ 5.0,  9.0, -2.0  ]\n        (Raw Vector B / The Knowledge Data)\n        ---\n        = [ 62.5, -0.65, -0.22 ]\n        (The Combined Wide Vector)\n","act_036":"W_down","note_022":"        Down Projection Matrix;\n        shrinks it back down\n        to its original model dimension (e.g., 4,096)","act_037":"FFN for embedding 2","act_038":"FFN for embedding N","act_039":"Matrix Assembly","note_023":"    Stacking by Position Order\n    * A data organization step handled by GPU memory.\n    * It changes the physical layout of the vectors,\n      stacking them rows-by-row into a matrix block.\n    * Concatenation / Stacking (No math, just moving data blocks).","act_040":"Residual Connection","note_024":"    Adds the stream saved before the pre-FFN RMSNorm to the FFN output.\n    This sum is the input of the next layer.","cond_003":"Yes","act_041":"Final RMSNorm","note_025":"  One last RMSNorm after the final layer, before the LM Head.\n  The stream has accumulated N layers of additions, so it is rescaled\n  once more to keep the logits at a sane scale (own gamma).","act_042":"Slicing","note_026":"matrix slicing operation (or index selection)\nto grab only the very last vector in the sequence\n(inference only: next-token prediction needs just the last position).\nTraining keeps the vectors of ALL positions and computes the loss on each\n(targets are the inputs shifted by one token).","part_007":"LM Head","note_027":"it uses a massive weight matrix called\nW_vocab to convert the vector back\ninto word scores.","act_043":"Linear Projection (W_vocab)","note_028":"Unembedding layer\n* The Grid Size: The W_vocab matrix has a shape of [Model_Dimension, Vocabulary_Size].\nIf a model has a vector size of 4,096 and knows 128,000 words (tokens) in its dictionary,\nthis matrix is a massive grid of numbers.\n\n* The Logits Output: The final vector (size 4,096) is multiplied by this W_vocab matrix.\nThis operation compares the final vector against every single word in the model's\nvocabulary simultaneously, outputting a list of 128,000 raw numbers called Logits.\nExample: h x W_vocab -> logits = [0.50, -0.15, 1.25, 3.00, -0.70]\n(cat, on, desk, water, the)","act_044":"Temperature and Top-K","note_029":"Applied to the logits, before Softmax:\n* Logits are divided by Temperature (0 = greedy, just take the argmax).\n* Top-K keeps only the K highest logits; the rest are set to -inf.\nExample (T = 1.0, K = 3): logits / 1.0 = unchanged; keep water 3.00, desk 1.25, cat 0.50; on and the become -inf","act_045":"Softmax","act_046":"Top-P and Sampling Selection","act_047":"Input tokens (prompt + generated so far)","note_030":"Applied to the probabilities, after Softmax:\n* Top-P (nucleus): sort by probability, add up from the largest until the total reaches P; keep those, drop the rest. Renormalize the kept ones to sum to 1, then sample one at random.\nExample, Softmax output: water 0.796, desk 0.138, cat 0.065 (e^x = 20.09, 3.49, 1.65; sum 25.22)\n  P = 0.9: water 0.796, then + desk = 0.934 >= 0.9, stop; cat is dropped; Renormalize: water 0.852, desk 0.148 (each / 0.934). Sample: 85% \"water\"; say \"water\" is drawn","cond_004":"EOS token or max length reached?","cond_005":"No","cond_006":"Yes","note_031":"If the model needs to keep writing (No), it takes that newly generated word (\"water\")\nand loops back to the Embedding step. Only the new token is processed (Decode); the earlier\ntokens are served from the KV cache instead of being recomputed.","legend_001":"Color","legend_002":"Meaning","legend_003":"Input: tokens, embedding","legend_004":"RMSNorm (pre-norm)","legend_005":"Attention: Q/K/V, RoPE, scores, mask, softmax, mix, W_O","legend_006":"Residual connection (adds the saved stream back)","legend_007":"Feed-forward network (SwiGLU)","legend_008":"LM head, sampling","legend_009":"A fork = steps that run in parallel.","note_032":"    Each loop iteration is one layer = one transformer block (N layers, e.g. 32 in Llama 3 8B),\n    each with its own weights (not shared between layers).\n    Weights of ONE layer (Llama 3 8B, d_model = 4096): learned in training, frozen when generating.\n\n    |= Where |= Weight |= Shape |\n    | RMSNorm before attention | gamma | 4096 |\n    | Attention | W_Q | 4096 x 4096 |\n    |  | W_K | 4096 x 1024 |\n    |  | W_V | 4096 x 1024 |\n    |  | W_O | 4096 x 4096 |\n    | RMSNorm before FFN | gamma | 4096 |\n    | FFN (SwiGLU) | W_gate | 4096 x 14336 |\n    |  | W_up | 4096 x 14336 |\n    |  | W_down | 14336 x 4096 |\n    About 218M parameters per layer x 32 layers = 7B (+ embedding and LM head 1B = 8B in total).","note_033":"Loop start: the loop returns here.\n1st pass: input = prompt. Later: input + last sampled token.\nRepeats until EOS or max length (decision at the bottom).","note_034":"[1, 2] x R_position 0\n-> [1, 2]  (0°: unchanged)","note_035":"[2, 1] x R_position 0\n-> [2, 1]  (0°: unchanged)","note_038":"desk, position 2 (180°):\nQ: [0, -2] -> [0, 2]\nK: [-1, 1] -> [1, -1]","note_036":"[1, -1] x R_position 1\n-> [1, 1]  (90°)","note_037":"[2, 1] x R_position 1\n-> [-1, 2]  (90°)","note_039":"q_cat = [1, 2]\nq_cat x k_cat = (1x2) + (2x1) = 4.0\nq_cat x k_on = (1x-1) + (2x2) = 3.0\nq_cat x k_desk = (1x1) + (2x-1) = -1.0","note_040":"q_on = [1, 1]\nq_on x k_cat = (1x2) + (1x1) = 3.0\nq_on x k_on = (1x-1) + (1x2) = 1.0\nq_on x k_desk = (1x1) + (1x-1) = 0.0","note_041":"q_desk = [0, 2]\nq_desk x k_cat = (0x2) + (2x1) = 2.0\nq_desk x k_on = (0x-1) + (2x2) = 4.0\nq_desk x k_desk = (0x1) + (2x-1) = -2.0","note_042":"Toy example (d_model = 4, 5-word vocabulary)\nFinal vector h = [0.5, -1.0, 1.0, 2.0]\nW_vocab is [4, 5], one column per word:\n  cat   = [ 0.2,  0.1, -0.3,  0.4]\n  on    = [-0.5,  0.3,  0.2,  0.1]\n  desk  = [ 0.1, -0.2,  0.4,  0.3]\n  water = [ 0.6, -0.4,  0.5,  0.9]\n  the   = [ 0.0,  0.2, -0.1, -0.2]\nLogit = h . column. For \"water\":\n  water = 0.30 + 0.40 + 0.50 + 1.80 = 3.00\n(other columns: same way)\nlogits = [0.50, -0.15, 1.25, 3.00, -0.70]\n\"water\" has the highest score.","note_043":"    \"Llama-style\" = Meta's Llama tweaks to the decoder-only Transformer (same core as GPT, GPT-1 2018); now shared by most open models.\n    |= Part |= Original Transformer (2017) / GPT-2 (2019) |= Llama-style (Meta: Llama 1 Feb 2023, Llama 2 Jul 2023, Llama 3 Apr 2024) |\n    | Normalization | LayerNorm; post-norm (2017), pre-norm (GPT-2) | RMSNorm (2019), pre-norm |\n    | Position | Absolute position embedding added to input | RoPE (2021): rotates Q and K |\n    | FFN, bias | 2 matrices + ReLU / GELU, with biases | SwiGLU (2020): gate, up, down; no biases |\n    | K / V heads | Multi-head: as many K/V as Q heads | GQA (2023): fewer K/V heads (Llama 2 70B, 3; not drawn) |"},"zh-tw":{"title_001":"Decoder-only Transformer（Llama 風格）：生成／推論流程","source_001":"原始碼： https://github.com/chronicqazxc/transformer-architecture-uml","act_002":"嵌入 (Embedding)","note_001":"    [-0.251, 0.901, 0.464, 0.197] (embedding_cat)\n    [-0.688, -0.688, -0.884, 0.732] (embedding_on)\n    [0.202, 0.416, -0.959, 0.940] (embedding_desk)\n    * 假設它就是矩陣 X\n    * 第 1 次（Prefill）：整段提示 [\"cat\", \"on\", \"desk\"] 一次平行做嵌入並處理。\n    * 之後（Decode）：只對新生成的 token 做嵌入；\n      先前 token 的 K 和 V 直接從 KV 快取取用。","cond_001":"N 層（Transformer 區塊）都完成了嗎？","cond_002":"否","cond_003":"是","cond_005":"否","cond_006":"是","cond_004":"遇到 EOS token 或達到最大長度？","act_003":"RMSNorm（注意力之前）","note_002":"    Pre-norm（Llama 風格）：在注意力「之前」先對該層的輸入做正規化。\n    * 未經正規化的輸入另外保留，作為殘差流 (residual stream)。\n    * RMSNorm = x / sqrt(mean(x^2) + eps) x 學到的縮放 (gamma)（不做平均值置中，沒有 bias）。\n\n    為什麼注意力之前要正規化？\n    * 每一層都會把注意力的輸出「加回」殘差流，所以殘差流的數值尺度會隨層數越疊越大（100、100.5、...）。\n    * 輸入太大會讓 Q x K^T 變得極大：softmax 飽和（輸出趨近 0 或 1），梯度趨近 0，訓練變得不穩定（梯度爆炸 / 消失）。\n    * RMSNorm 把殘差流的「複本」重設回標準尺度，注意力永遠拿到安全的輸入，輸出也保持小而穩定。\n    * 只有複本被正規化，殘差流本身不動，梯度可以直接經過「+」回傳到淺層（Pre-norm，不像原始 Transformer 的 post-norm：不需要脆弱的 warm-up）。\n    * RMSNorm 省掉 LayerNorm 的減平均值步驟：穩定效果相同，計算更省。","part_001":"多頭注意力 (Multi-Head Attention)","part_002":"Q K V 投影與 RoPE","part_003":"語意生成","part_004":"幾何旋轉","part_005":"點積","part_006":"前饋網路 (Feed-Forward Network)","part_007":"LM Head（輸出層）","act_004":"原始 K 矩陣 = X x W_K","act_005":"原始 Q 矩陣 = X x W_Q","act_007":"最終 Q_cat = 原始 Q_cat x R_position 0","act_008":"最終 K_cat = 原始 K_cat x R_position 0","act_009":"最終 Q_on = 原始 Q_on x R_position 1","act_010":"最終 K_on = 原始 K_on x R_position 1","act_012":"原始分數 cat = [q_cat x k_cat, q_cat x k_on, q_cat x k_desk]","act_013":"原始分數 on = [q_on x k_cat, q_on x k_on, q_on x k_desk]","act_014":"原始分數 desk = [q_desk x k_cat, q_desk x k_on, q_desk x k_desk]","note_003":"          線性投影（矩陣乘法）：X x W_Q、X x W_K、X x W_V（下面的範例數值為假設）。\n          Q (Query，查詢) = token 正在找什麼。K (Key，鍵) = 它提供的標籤。\n          V (Value，值) = 被選中時，它要傳出去的內容。\n          Q 和 K 決定「要聽誰的」；V 是「實際拿走什麼」。\n          範例設定（下面用到的名詞）：\n          |= 名詞 |= 意思 |= 範例（顯示 head 1） |= Llama 3 8B |\n          | d_model | 一個 token 向量的長度 | 4 | 4096 |\n          | n_heads | 平行的注意力 head 數（各有自己的 W_Q、W_K、W_V；它們的 Z 會串接回 d_model） | 2（算出 head 1；head 2 只畫出來、不計算） | 32 |\n          | d_k = d_head = d_model / n_heads | 每個 head 中一個 Q、K 或 V 列的長度 | 4 / 2 = 2（V 列也一樣：d_v = d_k） | 4096 / 32 = 128 |","note_004":"          目前原始的 Q 和 K 矩陣只帶有語意資訊，還完全沒有順序的概念。\n          正是這一刻，RoPE（旋轉位置編碼，Rotary Position Embedding）登場，完成它們的生成。\n          RoPE 只旋轉 Q 和 K（絕不旋轉 V）。\n          這個範例的玩具旋轉（d_k = 2，只有一對維度）：(0, 1) 每個位置轉 90°。\n          90°：[a, b] -> [-b, a]。180°：[a, b] -> [-a, -b]。\n          （真正的 RoPE 會旋轉 head 內的每一對維度，各有自己的頻率。）\n          最終的 K 和 V 會被加入 KV 快取，所以在 Decode 階段，\n          只需要計算新 token 的 Q、K、V。","note_005":"        目的：評分每個 token 的 Key 與目前 token 的 Query 有多相關（「token i 該看 token j 多少？」）。\n        點積 q x k：逐項相乘再全部加總（算式見上方「原始分數」方塊）；\n        很大 = 方向相近（key 符合 query），接近 0 = 不相關。\n        GPU 一次算完所有組合，Q x K^T：[3, 2] x [2, 3] = 3 × 3 分數表（第 i 列第 j 欄），\n        每格 = 2 次乘加（d_k = 2），是原始分數，還不是權重：\n        [4.0, 3.0, -1.0]  <- 原始分數 cat\n        [3.0, 1.0, 0.0]  <- 原始分數 on\n        [2.0, 4.0, -2.0]  <- 原始分數 desk\n        \"cat\" 對自己的分數最高，\"on\" 最對齊 \"cat\"，\n        \"desk\" 最對齊 \"on\"，也對齊 \"cat\"。\n\n        Decode 階段只計算最後一列：新 token 的 query\n        對上所有已快取的 key（1 x seq_len 個分數）。","act_015":"縮放（除以 sqrt d_k）","note_006":"      為了避免數字爆炸、讓 Softmax 失去判斷力，整個表都要除以 sqrt d_k。\n      原因：每個分數是 d_k 個乘積的總和，d_k 越大分數越大；除以 sqrt d_k 讓尺度保持穩定。\n      這裡 d_k = 2（一個 Q 或 K 列的長度，見線性投影註解的表格），所以 sqrt d_k = sqrt 2 = 1.41。\n      GPU 把矩陣裡的每一格都除以 1.41。\n\n      [4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, 3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, -1.0 / 1.41 = -0.71]\n      [3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, 1.0 / 1.41 = 0.71, 0.0 / 1.41 = 0.0]\n      [2.0 / 1.41 = 1.41, 4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, -2.0 / 1.41 = -1.41]","act_016":"因果遮罩（過濾規則）","note_007":"      因果遮罩就是在這個子步驟出手。\n      系統比較 Query（列）的位置 ID\n      與 Key（欄）的位置 ID。\n      規則：如果 Key 的位置 > Query 的位置，\n      它就是未來的 token，把分數換成負無限大 (-∞)。\n\n      [2.83, -∞, -∞]\n      [2.12, 0.71, -∞]\n      [1.41, 2.83, -1.41]","act_017":"Softmax 放大（產生百分比）","note_008":"      當這個遮罩後的表送進 Softmax，\n      每一列都處理得很漂亮：第 0 列 (\"cat\")：因為 e^-∞ = 0，\n      未來的位置權重絕對是 0%，\"cat\" 只能 100% 看自己。\n      第 1 列 (\"on\")：\"desk\" 的未來位置是 0%。剩下的分數 (2.12 和 0.71) 互相競爭，\n      結果約為 80% cat 和 20% on (e^2.12 = 8.33，e^0.71 = 2.03，8.33 / 10.37 = 0.80)。\n      第 2 列 (\"desk\")：沒有任何值被擋掉。\n      縮放後的分數 (1.41, 2.83, -1.41) 公開競爭，結果約為\n      19% cat、80% on、1% desk (e^1.41 = 4.10，e^2.83 = 16.95，e^-1.41 = 0.24，除以它們的總和 21.29)。","act_018":"注意力圖矩陣","act_019":"Value 矩陣乘法（混合）","note_010":"      在這一步，模型把注意力圖矩陣乘上 Value 矩陣 (V)。\n      這裡是 token 真正交換資訊的地方：每個 token 的輸出 Z，是它所關注的 token 的 Value 向量的加權總和（例如 \"on\" = 80% 的 cat 的 V + 20% 自己的 V）。\n\n      Context 矩陣 (Z)=Attention_Map x V\n\n      為了用數學看清楚，先算 head 1，並假設每個詞的 Value 向量有 d_head = 2 個數字，和 Q、K 一樣長（真實模型如 Llama 3，d_head 通常是每個 head 128 個數字）。\n      我們幫 Value 向量指定一些像樣的語意數字：\n      V_cat = [2.0, -1.0]\n      V_on = [0.0, 3.0]\n      V_desk = [5.0, 1.0]\n\n      GPU 把 Attention Map 每一列的權重乘上 Value 的各欄。\n      這是標準的加權總和，每一列同時平行計算：","note_014":"      Context 矩陣 (Z) = [\n        Slot 0: [2.0, -1.0]    (\"cat\" 的 context 向量)\n        Slot 1: [1.6, -0.2]    (\"on\" 的 context 向量)\n        Slot 2: [0.43, 2.22]  (\"desk\" 的 context 向量)\n      ]","act_023":"第 2 個 head 的注意力","note_015":"    線性投影\n    把所有平行的注意力 head 融合在一起\n    * 一個由可訓練參數（權重）組成、學習而來的投影層\n    * 它會改變向量內部的數字，\n    把不同 head 的 context 融合在一起。\n    * 矩陣乘法 (×)\n    1. W_O 之前（分開的洞察）：N 個 head（範例是 2 個，Llama 3 8B 是 32 個）各自從\n      不同的邏輯角度看這個句子。\n      * Head 1 輸出一個代表文法結構的小向量。\n      * Head 2 輸出一個代表動物特徵的小向量。\n\n    2. 串接步驟：模型把這 N 個獨立的向量並排接在一起，\n      形成一個超寬的向量。此刻這些值\n      還只是原始、各自獨立的資訊，尚未被融合。\n\n    3. W_O 乘法 (×)：這個寬向量乘上 W_O 矩陣。\n\n    \"on\" 的範例（上面的逐步計算算的是 head 1；head 2 與 W_O 為假設值）：\n    Output = Concat_Z x W_O   ([3, 4] x [4, 4] -> [3, 4], W_O assumed; real: [d_model, d_model])\n    Head 1 Z_on = [1.6, -0.2]   Head 2 Z_on = [1.0, 0.5]\n    Concatenated = [1.6, -0.2, 1.0, 0.5]   (2 + 2 = d_model = 4)\n    Column 0 of W_O = [0.5, -0.2, 0.4, 1.0]\n    Output[0] = 1.6x0.5 + (-0.2)x(-0.2) + 1.0x0.4 + 0.5x1.0\n              = 0.8 + 0.04 + 0.4 + 0.5 = 1.74\n    Head 1 貢獻 0.84 + head 2 貢獻 0.9：一個數字就已混合兩個 head。\n    4 欄全部算完：\"on\" 的注意力輸出 = [1.74, -0.6, 0.17, 0.78]","act_026":"殘差連接 (Residual Connection)","act_040":"殘差連接 (Residual Connection)","note_016":"    把該層的輸入（在 pre-attention RMSNorm 之前保留下來的殘差流）\n    加回注意力的輸出，避免資訊流失\n\n    第 1 層中 \"on\" 的 toy 範例（數值都來自上方）：\n    該層輸入 (embedding_on)  = [-0.688, -0.688, -0.884, 0.732]\n    \"on\" 的注意力輸出        = [1.74, -0.6, 0.17, 0.78]\n    相加（逐元素）           = [1.052, -1.288, -0.714, 1.512]\n    原本的 embedding 仍留在總和裡：該層只需學「變化量」。","act_027":"RMSNorm（FFN 之前）","note_017":"    Pre-norm：在 FFN「之前」做正規化。未經正規化的殘差流\n    （上面殘差相加之後的結果）另外保留，留給下一次殘差相加。\n\n    這是第二個獨立的 RMSNorm（公式相同，但有自己的 gamma）。\n    * 它的輸入是 x1 = x0 + 注意力輸出，也就是上面殘差相加的結果。\n      這次相加又讓殘差流的尺度變大了。\n    * FFN 的 SwiGLU 活化函數對輸入尺度很敏感，\n      所以進 FFN 前先把 x1 的複本正規化。","note_018":"        目的：attention 在 token 之間傳遞資訊，\n        FFN 再對每個 token 的向量各自處理\n        (加入非線性)。\n        做法：擴張 (gate、up)，SiLU 閘門過濾，\n        與 up 相乘，W_down 壓縮回 d_model。","act_028":"輸入的 token 向量","note_019":"        模型拿到你的 token 向量\n        （例如維度 4,096），分別乘上兩個獨立的\n        權重矩陣，把它投影到大得多的\n        隱藏維度——通常寬 2.7 到 3.5 倍\n        （例如 Llama 3 8B 從 4,096 擴張到 14,336 個數字 = 3.5 倍；\n        小模型可能用 8/3 = 2.67 倍）。","act_030":"向量 A（之前）","act_031":"活化函數 (Activation function)","note_020":"            SiLU(x) = x · sigmoid(x)（SwiGLU，如 Llama；有些模型改用 GELU）\n            * 很大的負值 -> 被壓到接近 0（幾乎關閉）\n            * 很大的正值 -> 幾乎原樣通過（開啟）","act_032":"向量 A（之後）","act_034":"向量 B","act_035":"合併","note_021":"        逐元素相乘\n        [ 12.5, -0.072, 0.110 ]\n        （活化後的向量 A／過濾器）\n        × [ 5.0,  9.0, -2.0  ]\n        （原始向量 B／知識資料）\n        ---\n        = [ 62.5, -0.65, -0.22 ]\n        （合併後的寬向量）\n","note_022":"        降維投影矩陣；\n        把它縮回\n        原本的模型維度（例如 4,096）","act_037":"第 2 個 embedding 的 FFN","act_038":"第 N 個 embedding 的 FFN","act_039":"矩陣組裝","note_023":"    依位置順序堆疊\n    * 由 GPU 記憶體處理的資料整理步驟。\n    * 它改變向量的實體排列，\n      一列一列堆成一個矩陣。\n    * 串接／堆疊（沒有數學運算，只是搬移資料區塊）。","note_024":"    把 pre-FFN RMSNorm 之前保留的殘差流加到 FFN 的輸出。\n    這個總和就是下一層的輸入。","act_041":"最後的 RMSNorm","note_025":"  最後一層之後、LM Head 之前，再做最後一次 RMSNorm。\n  殘差流累積了 N 層的相加結果，這裡再重設一次尺度，\n  讓 logits 的數值大小合理（有自己的 gamma）。","act_042":"切片 (Slicing)","note_026":"矩陣切片運算（或索引選取），\n只取序列中最後一個向量\n（僅限推論：預測下一個 token 只需要最後一個位置）。\n訓練則保留「所有」位置的向量，並對每個位置計算 loss\n（目標是把輸入位移一個 token）。","note_027":"它使用一個巨大的權重矩陣，叫做\nW_vocab，把向量轉回\n詞的分數。","note_028":"Unembedding 層\n* 表格大小：W_vocab 矩陣的形狀是 [Model_Dimension, Vocabulary_Size]。\n如果模型的向量維度是 4,096，詞典裡有 128,000 個詞 (token)，\n這個矩陣就是一張巨大的數字表。\n\n* Logits 輸出：最後的向量（維度 4,096）乘上這個 W_vocab 矩陣。\n這個運算同時把最後的向量與模型詞彙表裡的每一個詞做比較，\n輸出 128,000 個原始數字，稱為 Logits。\n範例：h x W_vocab -> logits = [0.50, -0.15, 1.25, 3.00, -0.70]\n(cat, on, desk, water, the)","act_044":"Temperature 與 Top-K","act_046":"Top-P 與抽樣選擇","act_047":"輸入 token（提示 + 目前已生成的）","note_029":"套用在 logits 上，在 Softmax 之前：\n* Logits 先除以 Temperature（0 = greedy，直接取 argmax）。\n* Top-K 只保留最高的 K 個 logits，其餘設為 -inf。\n範例 (T = 1.0, K = 3)：logits / 1.0 = 不變；；保留 water 3.00, desk 1.25, cat 0.50；on 和 the 變成 -inf","note_030":"套用在機率上，在 Softmax 之後：\n* Top-P (nucleus)：依機率由大到小逐一累加，加到總和達到 P 為止；保留這些，其餘捨棄。 把保留的機率重新正規化成總和 1，再隨機抽出一個。\n範例，Softmax 輸出：water 0.796, desk 0.138, cat 0.065 (e^x = 20.09, 3.49, 1.65；總和 25.22)\n  P = 0.9：water 0.796，再 + desk = 0.934 >= 0.9，停止；cat 捨棄; 重新正規化：water 0.852, desk 0.148 (各 / 0.934)。抽樣：85% \"water\"；假設抽到 \"water\"","note_031":"如果模型需要繼續寫（否），它會拿剛生成的字 (\"water\")\n回到 Embedding 步驟。只處理新的 token（Decode）；先前的\ntoken 由 KV 快取提供，不需要重新計算。","legend_001":"顏色","legend_002":"意義","legend_003":"輸入：tokens、embedding","legend_004":"RMSNorm（pre-norm）","legend_005":"注意力：Q/K/V、RoPE、分數、遮罩、softmax、混合、W_O","legend_006":"殘差連接（把保留的殘差流加回來）","legend_007":"前饋網路 (SwiGLU)","legend_008":"LM head、抽樣","legend_009":"fork = 平行執行的步驟。","note_032":"    每一次迴圈 = 一層 = 一個 Transformer 區塊（N 層，例如 Llama 3 8B 有 32 層），\n    每一層都有自己的權重（層與層之間不共用）。\n    「一層」的權重（Llama 3 8B，d_model = 4096）：訓練時學到，生成時固定不變。\n\n    |= 位置 |= 權重 |= 形狀 |\n    | 注意力前的 RMSNorm | gamma | 4096 |\n    | 注意力 (Attention) | W_Q | 4096 x 4096 |\n    |  | W_K | 4096 x 1024 |\n    |  | W_V | 4096 x 1024 |\n    |  | W_O | 4096 x 4096 |\n    | FFN 前的 RMSNorm | gamma | 4096 |\n    | FFN (SwiGLU) | W_gate | 4096 x 14336 |\n    |  | W_up | 4096 x 14336 |\n    |  | W_down | 14336 x 4096 |\n    每層約 218M 參數 x 32 層 = 70 億（再加 embedding 與 LM head 共 10 億，總計 80 億）。","note_033":"迴圈起點：迴圈會回到這裡。\n第 1 次：輸入 = 提示。之後：輸入 + 上一輪取樣的 token。\n重複到遇到 EOS 或達到最大長度（判斷在最下方）。","note_034":"[1, 2] x R_position 0\n-> [1, 2]  （0°：不變）","note_035":"[2, 1] x R_position 0\n-> [2, 1]  （0°：不變）","note_038":"desk，位置 2（180°）：\nQ: [0, -2] -> [0, 2]\nK: [-1, 1] -> [1, -1]","note_042":"範例 (d_model = 4，詞彙表 5 個詞)\n最後的向量 h = [0.5, -1.0, 1.0, 2.0]\nW_vocab 是 [4, 5]，每個詞一欄：\n  cat   = [ 0.2,  0.1, -0.3,  0.4]\n  on    = [-0.5,  0.3,  0.2,  0.1]\n  desk  = [ 0.1, -0.2,  0.4,  0.3]\n  water = [ 0.6, -0.4,  0.5,  0.9]\n  the   = [ 0.0,  0.2, -0.1, -0.2]\nLogit = h 乘該欄。以 \"water\" 為例：\n  water = 0.30 + 0.40 + 0.50 + 1.80 = 3.00\n(其他欄做法相同)\nlogits = [0.50, -0.15, 1.25, 3.00, -0.70]\n\"water\" 的分數最高。","act_025":"線性投影 (W_O)","note_043":"    「Llama 風格」= Meta Llama 對 decoder-only Transformer 的改良（核心和 GPT 相同，GPT-1 為 2018）；現在多數開源模型也採用。\n    |= 部分 |= 原始 Transformer（2017）／GPT-2（2019） |= Llama 風格（Meta：Llama 1 2023 年 2 月、Llama 2 2023 年 7 月、Llama 3 2024 年 4 月） |\n    | 正規化 | LayerNorm；post-norm（2017）、pre-norm（GPT-2） | RMSNorm（2019），pre-norm |\n    | 位置資訊 | 絕對位置嵌入，加在輸入上 | RoPE（2021）：旋轉 Q 和 K |\n    | FFN、偏置 | 2 個矩陣 + ReLU / GELU，有偏置 | SwiGLU（2020）：gate、up、down；無偏置 |\n    | K / V 頭數 | Multi-head：K/V 頭數 = Q 頭數 | GQA（2023）：K/V 頭數較少（Llama 2 70B、3；未畫出） |","act_043":"線性投影 (W_vocab)"},"ja":{"title_001":"Decoder-only Transformer (Llama 型): 生成・推論フロー","source_001":"ソース: https://github.com/chronicqazxc/transformer-architecture-uml","act_001":"トークン (Tokens)","act_002":"エンベディング (Embedding)","note_001":"    [-0.251, 0.901, 0.464, 0.197] (embedding_cat)\n    [-0.688, -0.688, -0.884, 0.732] (embedding_on)\n    [0.202, 0.416, -0.959, 0.940] (embedding_desk)\n    * これを行列 X とします\n    * 1回目 (Prefill): プロンプト全体 [\"cat\", \"on\", \"desk\"] を一度に並列で\n      エンベディングして処理します。\n    * 2回目以降 (Decode): 新しく生成したトークンだけをエンベディングします。\n      それ以前のトークンの K と V は KV キャッシュから再利用します。","cond_001":"N 層 (Transformer ブロック) すべて完了？","cond_002":"いいえ","cond_003":"はい","cond_005":"いいえ","cond_006":"はい","cond_004":"EOS トークンまたは最大長に到達？","act_003":"RMSNorm (アテンションの前)","note_002":"    Pre-norm (Llama 型): アテンションの「前」に、その層の入力を正規化します。\n    * 正規化前の入力は、残差ストリーム (residual stream) として取っておきます。\n    * RMSNorm = x / sqrt(mean(x^2) + eps) x 学習されたスケール (gamma) (平均の引き算なし、bias なし)。\n\n    なぜアテンションの前に正規化するのか?\n    * 各層はアテンションの出力を残差ストリームに「足し戻す」ので、ストリームのスケールは層が深くなるほど大きくなります (100、100.5、...)。\n    * 入力が大きいと Q x K^T が巨大になり、softmax が飽和 (出力が 0 か 1 に近づく)、勾配がほぼ 0 になって学習が不安定になります (勾配爆発 / 消失)。\n    * RMSNorm はストリームの「コピー」を標準的なスケールに戻すので、アテンションは常に安全な入力を受け取り、出力も小さく安定します。\n    * 正規化されるのはコピーだけで、残差ストリーム自体は変わりません。勾配は「+」を通って浅い層まで直接届きます(元の Transformer の post-norm と違い、Pre-norm では不安定な warm-up が不要)。\n    * RMSNorm は LayerNorm の平均の引き算を省きます: 安定性は同じで、計算は軽くなります。","part_001":"マルチヘッドアテンション (Multi-Head Attention)","part_002":"Q K V の射影と RoPE","part_003":"意味の生成","part_004":"幾何学的な回転","part_005":"内積","part_006":"フィードフォワードネットワーク (Feed-Forward Network)","part_007":"LM Head (出力層)","act_004":"生の K 行列 = X x W_K","act_005":"生の Q 行列 = X x W_Q","act_007":"最終 Q_cat = 生の Q_cat x R_position 0","act_008":"最終 K_cat = 生の K_cat x R_position 0","act_009":"最終 Q_on = 生の Q_on x R_position 1","act_010":"最終 K_on = 生の K_on x R_position 1","act_012":"生のスコア cat = [q_cat x k_cat, q_cat x k_on, q_cat x k_desk]","act_013":"生のスコア on = [q_on x k_cat, q_on x k_on, q_on x k_desk]","act_014":"生のスコア desk = [q_desk x k_cat, q_desk x k_on, q_desk x k_desk]","note_003":"          線形射影 (行列の掛け算): X x W_Q, X x W_K, X x W_V (下の数値は仮定した例)。\n          Q (Query) = トークンが探しているもの。K (Key) = 差し出すラベル。\n          V (Value) = 選ばれたときに渡す中身。\n          Q と K は「誰の話を聞くか」、V は「何を受け取るか」を決めます。\n          例の設定 (以下で使う用語):\n          |= 用語 |= 意味 |= 例 (head 1 を表示) |= Llama 3 8B |\n          | d_model | 1 トークンのベクトルの長さ | 4 | 4096 |\n          | n_heads | 並列のアテンション head の数 (各 head が独自の W_Q, W_K, W_V を持つ。Z は連結して d_model に戻る) | 2 (head 1 を計算; head 2 は描くだけで計算しない) | 32 |\n          | d_k = d_head = d_model / n_heads | head ごとの Q, K, V の 1 行の長さ | 4 / 2 = 2 (V の行も同じ: d_v = d_k) | 4096 / 32 = 128 |","note_004":"          今のところ、生の Q と K 行列には意味の情報しかなく、\n          並び順の概念はまだありません。まさにこの瞬間に RoPE\n          (回転位置埋め込み, Rotary Position Embedding) が登場して、生成を仕上げます。\n          RoPE が回転させるのは Q と K だけです (V は決して回転させません)。\n          この例の簡易な回転 (d_k = 2 なので次元ペアは 1 つ): (0, 1) が位置ごとに 90° 回ります。\n          90°: [a, b] -> [-b, a]。180°: [a, b] -> [-a, -b]。\n          (実際の RoPE は head 内のすべての次元ペアを、それぞれの周波数で回転させます。)\n          最終的な K と V は KV キャッシュに追加されるので、Decode のときは\n          新しいトークンの Q, K, V だけを計算します。","note_005":"        目的: 各トークンの Key が今のトークンの Query にどれだけ関係あるかを採点 (「トークン i は j をどれだけ見る?」)。\n        内積 q x k: 要素ごとに掛けて全部を足します (計算は上の「生のスコア」ボックス)。\n        大きい = 向きが近い (key が query に合う)、0 に近い = 無関係。\n        GPU は全ペアを一度に採点します、Q x K^T: [3, 2] x [2, 3] = 3 × 3 の表 (i 行 j 列)、\n        各セル = 2 回の積和 (d_k = 2)。まだ重みではなく生のスコアです:\n        [4.0, 3.0, -1.0]  <- 生のスコア cat\n        [3.0, 1.0, 0.0]  <- 生のスコア on\n        [2.0, 4.0, -2.0]  <- 生のスコア desk\n        \"cat\" は自分自身のスコアが最も高く、\"on\" は \"cat\" に最も対応し、\n        \"desk\" は \"on\" に最も対応し、\"cat\" にも対応しています。\n\n        Decode のときは最後の行だけを計算します: 新しいトークンの query を\n        キャッシュ済みのすべての key と掛けます (1 x seq_len 個のスコア)。","act_015":"スケーリング (sqrt d_k で割る)","note_006":"      数字が大きくなりすぎて Softmax 層が見分けられなくなるのを防ぐため、表全体を sqrt d_k で割ります。\n      理由: 各スコアは d_k 個の積の合計なので d_k とともに大きくなります。sqrt d_k で割ると大きさが安定します。\n      ここでは d_k = 2 (Q または K の 1 行の長さ。線形射影のノートの表を参照) なので、sqrt d_k = sqrt 2 = 1.41 です。\n      GPU は行列のすべてのセルを 1.41 で割ります。\n\n      [4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, 3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, -1.0 / 1.41 = -0.71]\n      [3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, 1.0 / 1.41 = 0.71, 0.0 / 1.41 = 0.0]\n      [2.0 / 1.41 = 1.41, 4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, -2.0 / 1.41 = -1.41]","act_016":"因果マスク (フィルタのルール)","note_007":"      まさにこの小さなステップで因果マスクが働きます。\n      システムは Query (行) の位置 ID を\n      Key (列) の位置 ID と比べます。\n      ルール: Key の位置 > Query の位置なら、\n      それは未来のトークンです。スコアを負の無限大 (-∞) に置き換えます。\n\n      [2.83, -∞, -∞]\n      [2.12, 0.71, -∞]\n      [1.41, 2.83, -1.41]","act_017":"Softmax による強調 (百分率の生成)","note_008":"      このマスク後の表を Softmax に入れると、\n      各行がきれいに処理されます: 行 0 (\"cat\"): e^-∞ = 0 なので、\n      未来のスロットの重みはきっかり 0%。\"cat\" は 100% 自分だけを見ます。\n      行 1 (\"on\"): \"desk\" の未来スロットは 0%。残りのスコア (2.12 と 0.71) が競い合い、\n      結果は cat 約 80%、on 約 20% (e^2.12 = 8.33、e^0.71 = 2.03、8.33 / 10.37 = 0.80)。\n      行 2 (\"desk\"): 隠された値はありません。\n      スケーリング後のスコア (1.41, 2.83, -1.41) が公平に競い合い、結果は\n      cat 約 19%、on 約 80%、desk 約 1% (e^1.41 = 4.10、e^2.83 = 16.95、e^-1.41 = 0.24 をその合計 21.29 で割る)。","act_018":"アテンションマップ行列","act_019":"Value 行列の掛け算 (混ぜ合わせ)","note_010":"      このステップでは、アテンションマップ行列に Value 行列 (V) を掛けます。\n      ここがトークン同士が実際に情報をやり取りする場所です: 各トークンの出力 Z は、注目先のトークンの Value ベクトルの重み付き和です (例: \"on\" = cat の V の 80% + 自分の V の 20%)。\n\n      コンテキスト行列 (Z)=Attention_Map x V\n\n      数式で確かめるために、head 1 を計算し、各単語の Value ベクトルは d_head = 2 個の数字、Q や K と同じ長さとします (Llama 3 のような実際のモデルでは、d_head は通常 1 ヘッドあたり 128 個の数字です)。\n      Value ベクトルにそれらしい意味の数字を割り当てます:\n      V_cat = [2.0, -1.0]\n      V_on = [0.0, 3.0]\n      V_desk = [5.0, 1.0]\n\n      GPU はアテンションマップの各行の重みを、Value の各列に掛けます。\n      これは標準的な重み付き和で、各行を同時に並列で計算します:","note_014":"      コンテキスト行列 (Z) = [\n        Slot 0: [2.0, -1.0]    (\"cat\" のコンテキストベクトル)\n        Slot 1: [1.6, -0.2]    (\"on\" のコンテキストベクトル)\n        Slot 2: [0.43, 2.22]  (\"desk\" のコンテキストベクトル)\n      ]","act_023":"ヘッド 2 のアテンション","note_015":"    線形射影\n    並列に動くすべてのアテンションヘッドを混ぜ合わせます\n    * 学習可能なパラメータ (重み) でできた、学習される射影層\n    * ベクトルの中の数字を変えて、\n    異なるヘッドのコンテキストを混ぜ合わせます。\n    * 行列の掛け算 (×)\n    1. W_O の前 (バラバラの洞察): N 個のヘッド (例は 2 個、Llama 3 8B は 32 個)が、それぞれ\n      違う論理的な角度から文を見ています。\n      * ヘッド 1 は文法構造を表す小さなベクトルを出力します。\n      * ヘッド 2 は動物の特徴を表す小さなベクトルを出力します。\n\n    2. 連結ステップ: モデルはこの N 個のバラバラのベクトルを横に並べて、\n      とても幅の広い1本のベクトルにします。この時点では、\n      値はまだ生のままの独立した情報で、混ぜ合わされていません。\n\n    3. W_O の掛け算 (×): この幅広のベクトルに W_O 行列を掛けます。\n\n    \"on\" の例 (上の手順で計算したのはヘッド 1。ヘッド 2 と W_O は仮の値):\n    Output = Concat_Z x W_O   ([3, 4] x [4, 4] -> [3, 4], W_O assumed; real: [d_model, d_model])\n    Head 1 Z_on = [1.6, -0.2]   Head 2 Z_on = [1.0, 0.5]\n    Concatenated = [1.6, -0.2, 1.0, 0.5]   (2 + 2 = d_model = 4)\n    Column 0 of W_O = [0.5, -0.2, 0.4, 1.0]\n    Output[0] = 1.6x0.5 + (-0.2)x(-0.2) + 1.0x0.4 + 0.5x1.0\n              = 0.8 + 0.04 + 0.4 + 0.5 = 1.74\n    ヘッド 1 が 0.84 + ヘッド 2 が 0.9: 1 個の数字で両ヘッドが混ざっています。\n    4 列すべて: \"on\" のアテンション出力 = [1.74, -0.6, 0.17, 0.78]","act_026":"残差接続 (Residual Connection)","act_040":"残差接続 (Residual Connection)","note_016":"    その層の入力 (pre-attention RMSNorm の前に取っておいた残差ストリーム) を\n    アテンションの出力に足して、情報の欠落を防ぎます\n\n    第 1 層の \"on\" の toy 例 (数値はすべて上のものを使用):\n    層への入力 (embedding_on)   = [-0.688, -0.688, -0.884, 0.732]\n    \"on\" のアテンション出力     = [1.74, -0.6, 0.17, 0.78]\n    合計 (要素ごと)             = [1.052, -1.288, -0.714, 1.512]\n    元の embedding は合計に残る: 層は変化分だけを学べばよい。","act_027":"RMSNorm (FFN の前)","note_017":"    Pre-norm: FFN の「前」に正規化します。正規化前のストリーム\n    (上の残差を足したあとのもの) は、次の残差の足し算のために取っておきます。\n\n    これは2つ目の独立した RMSNorm です (式は同じで、gamma は別)。\n    * 入力は x1 = x0 + アテンション出力、つまり上の残差の足し算の結果です。\n      この足し算でストリームのスケールがまた大きくなっています。\n    * FFN の SwiGLU 活性化は入力スケールに敏感なので、\n      FFN に入る前に x1 のコピーを正規化します。","note_018":"        目的: attention はトークン間で情報を運び、\n        FFN は各トークンのベクトルを個別に処理\n        します (非線形性を加える)。\n        方法: 広げ (gate, up)、SiLU ゲートで選別、\n        up と掛け、W_down で d_model に戻します。","act_028":"入ってくるトークンのベクトル","note_019":"        モデルはトークンのベクトル\n        (例: 次元 4,096) を、2つの別々の重み行列に掛けて、\n        ずっと大きな隠れ次元に射影します。\n        通常は約 2.7〜3.5 倍の幅です\n        (例: Llama 3 8B は 4,096 から 14,336 個に広がり 3.5 倍。\n        小さなモデルは 8/3 = 2.67 倍を使うこともあります)。","act_030":"ベクトル A (適用前)","act_031":"活性化関数 (Activation function)","note_020":"            SiLU(x) = x · sigmoid(x) (Llama のような SwiGLU。モデルによっては代わりに GELU)\n            * 大きな負の値 -> 0 に近づく (ほぼオフ)\n            * 大きな正の値 -> ほぼそのまま通る (オン)","act_032":"ベクトル A (適用後)","act_034":"ベクトル B","act_035":"結合","note_021":"        要素ごとの掛け算\n        [ 12.5, -0.072, 0.110 ]\n        (活性化後のベクトル A / フィルタ)\n        × [ 5.0,  9.0, -2.0  ]\n        (生のベクトル B / 知識のデータ)\n        ---\n        = [ 62.5, -0.65, -0.22 ]\n        (結合後の幅広ベクトル)\n","note_022":"        ダウン射影行列;\n        元のモデル次元\n        (例: 4,096) まで縮めます","act_037":"エンベディング 2 の FFN","act_038":"エンベディング N の FFN","act_039":"行列の組み立て","note_023":"    位置の順に積み重ねる\n    * GPU メモリが担当するデータ整理のステップ。\n    * ベクトルの物理的な配置を変えて、\n      行ごとに積み上げて行列にします。\n    * 連結・積み重ね (計算はなし、データのブロックを動かすだけ)。","note_024":"    pre-FFN RMSNorm の前に取っておいたストリームを FFN の出力に足します。\n    この合計が次の層の入力になります。","act_041":"最後の RMSNorm","note_025":"  最後の層のあと、LM Head の前に、もう一度だけ RMSNorm をかけます。\n  ストリームには N 層分の足し算が積もっているので、\n  ここでスケールを戻して logits を適切な大きさにします (独自の gamma)。","act_042":"スライス (Slicing)","note_026":"行列のスライス演算 (またはインデックスの選択) で、\n系列の一番最後のベクトルだけを取り出します\n(推論のみ: 次のトークンの予測には最後の位置だけが必要です)。\n学習では「すべての」位置のベクトルを残し、各位置で loss を計算します\n(正解は入力を1トークンずらしたものです)。","note_027":"W_vocab という巨大な重み行列を使って、\nベクトルを\n単語のスコアに戻します。","note_028":"アンエンベディング層\n* 表の大きさ: W_vocab 行列の形は [Model_Dimension, Vocabulary_Size] です。\nモデルのベクトルの次元が 4,096 で、辞書に 128,000 個の単語 (トークン) があるなら、\nこの行列は数字でできた巨大な表になります。\n\n* ロジットの出力: 最後のベクトル (次元 4,096) にこの W_vocab 行列を掛けます。\nこの演算は、最後のベクトルをモデルの語彙のすべての単語と同時に比べて、\nロジットと呼ばれる 128,000 個の生の数字のリストを出力します。\n例: h x W_vocab -> logits = [0.50, -0.15, 1.25, 3.00, -0.70]\n(cat, on, desk, water, the)","act_044":"Temperature と Top-K","act_046":"Top-P とサンプリングによる選択","act_047":"入力トークン (プロンプト + ここまでに生成した分)","note_029":"ロジットに適用します (Softmax の前):\n* ロジットを Temperature で割ります (0 = greedy、argmax をそのまま取る)。\n* Top-K は上位 K 個のロジットだけを残し、残りは -inf にします。\n例 (T = 1.0, K = 3): logits / 1.0 = 変わらず、、water 3.00, desk 1.25, cat 0.50 を残し、on と the は -inf","note_030":"確率に適用します (Softmax の後):\n* Top-P (nucleus): 確率の大きい順に、合計が P に達するまで足し合わせ、それらを残して残りは捨てます。 残した確率を合計 1 に再正規化し、ランダムに 1 つ選びます。\n例、Softmax の出力: water 0.796, desk 0.138, cat 0.065 (e^x = 20.09, 3.49, 1.65; 合計 25.22)\n  P = 0.9: water 0.796、次に + desk = 0.934 >= 0.9 で終了。cat は除外。再正規化: water 0.852, desk 0.148 (各 / 0.934)。サンプリング: 85% \"water\"、\"water\" が選ばれたとする","note_031":"モデルがまだ書き続ける必要があるとき (いいえ)、生成したばかりの単語 (\"water\") を取り、\nEmbedding のステップに戻ります。処理するのは新しいトークンだけ (Decode) で、それ以前の\nトークンは再計算せず KV キャッシュから取り出します。","legend_001":"色","legend_002":"意味","legend_003":"入力: トークン、エンベディング","legend_004":"RMSNorm (pre-norm)","legend_005":"アテンション: Q/K/V、RoPE、スコア、マスク、softmax、混合、W_O","legend_006":"残差接続 (取っておいたストリームを足し戻す)","legend_007":"フィードフォワードネットワーク (SwiGLU)","legend_008":"LM head、サンプリング","legend_009":"fork = 並列に実行されるステップ。","note_032":"    ループ1回 = 1層 = Transformer ブロック1つ (N 層。例: Llama 3 8B は 32 層)。\n    各層はそれぞれ独自の重みを持ちます (層どうしで共有しません)。\n    1層分の重み (Llama 3 8B, d_model = 4096): 学習で獲得し、生成時は固定です。\n\n    |= 場所 |= 重み |= 形状 |\n    | アテンション前の RMSNorm | gamma | 4096 |\n    | アテンション (Attention) | W_Q | 4096 x 4096 |\n    |  | W_K | 4096 x 1024 |\n    |  | W_V | 4096 x 1024 |\n    |  | W_O | 4096 x 4096 |\n    | FFN 前の RMSNorm | gamma | 4096 |\n    | FFN (SwiGLU) | W_gate | 4096 x 14336 |\n    |  | W_up | 4096 x 14336 |\n    |  | W_down | 14336 x 4096 |\n    1層あたり約 2.18 億パラメータ x 32 層 = 70 億 (+ embedding と LM head の 10 億 = 合計 80 億)。","note_033":"ループの開始点: ループはここに戻ります。\n1回目: 入力 = プロンプト。以降: 入力 + 前回サンプリングしたトークン。\nEOS か最大長に到達するまで繰り返します (判定は一番下)。","note_034":"[1, 2] x R_position 0\n-> [1, 2]  (0°: 変化なし)","note_035":"[2, 1] x R_position 0\n-> [2, 1]  (0°: 変化なし)","note_038":"desk、位置 2 (180°):\nQ: [0, -2] -> [0, 2]\nK: [-1, 1] -> [1, -1]","note_042":"例 (d_model = 4、語彙は 5 単語)\n最後のベクトル h = [0.5, -1.0, 1.0, 2.0]\nW_vocab は [4, 5]、単語ごとに 1 列：\n  cat   = [ 0.2,  0.1, -0.3,  0.4]\n  on    = [-0.5,  0.3,  0.2,  0.1]\n  desk  = [ 0.1, -0.2,  0.4,  0.3]\n  water = [ 0.6, -0.4,  0.5,  0.9]\n  the   = [ 0.0,  0.2, -0.1, -0.2]\nロジット = h と列の内積。\"water\" の場合：\n  water = 0.30 + 0.40 + 0.50 + 1.80 = 3.00\n(他の列も同様)\nlogits = [0.50, -0.15, 1.25, 3.00, -0.70]\n\"water\" のスコアが最も高い。","act_025":"線形射影 (W_O)","note_043":"    「Llama 型」= Meta の Llama による decoder-only Transformer の改良 (中核は GPT と同じ、GPT-1 は2018年)。今では多くのオープンモデルも採用。\n    |= 部分 |= 元の Transformer (2017) / GPT-2 (2019) |= Llama 型 (Meta: Llama 1 2023年2月、Llama 2 2023年7月、Llama 3 2024年4月) |\n    | 正規化 | LayerNorm。post-norm (2017)、pre-norm (GPT-2) | RMSNorm (2019)、pre-norm |\n    | 位置情報 | 絶対位置エンベディングを入力に加算 | RoPE (2021): Q と K を回転 |\n    | FFN、バイアス | 行列2つ + ReLU / GELU、バイアスあり | SwiGLU (2020): gate、up、down。バイアスなし |\n    | K / V ヘッド数 | Multi-head: K/V 数 = Q 数 | GQA (2023): K/V が少ない (Llama 2 70B、3。図は省略) |","act_043":"線形射影 (W_vocab)"},"ko":{"title_001":"Decoder-only Transformer (Llama 스타일): 생성 / 추론 흐름","source_001":"소스: https://github.com/chronicqazxc/transformer-architecture-uml","act_001":"토큰 (Tokens)","act_002":"임베딩 (Embedding)","note_001":"    [-0.251, 0.901, 0.464, 0.197] (embedding_cat)\n    [-0.688, -0.688, -0.884, 0.732] (embedding_on)\n    [0.202, 0.416, -0.959, 0.940] (embedding_desk)\n    * 이것을 행렬 X라고 하겠습니다\n    * 첫 번째 (Prefill): 프롬프트 전체 [\"cat\", \"on\", \"desk\"]를 한꺼번에 병렬로\n      임베딩하고 처리합니다.\n    * 이후 (Decode): 새로 생성된 토큰만 임베딩합니다.\n      앞선 토큰의 K와 V는 KV 캐시에서 재사용합니다.","cond_001":"N개 층(트랜스포머 블록)을 모두 마쳤는가?","cond_002":"아니오","cond_003":"예","cond_005":"아니오","cond_006":"예","cond_004":"EOS 토큰 또는 최대 길이에 도달?","act_003":"RMSNorm (어텐션 앞)","note_002":"    Pre-norm (Llama 스타일): 어텐션 \"앞에서\" 그 층의 입력을 정규화합니다.\n    * 정규화하지 않은 입력은 잔차 스트림(residual stream)으로 따로 보관합니다.\n    * RMSNorm = x / sqrt(mean(x^2) + eps) x 학습된 스케일 (gamma) (평균 빼기 없음, bias 없음).\n\n    왜 어텐션 앞에서 정규화할까?\n    * 모든 층이 어텐션 출력을 잔차 스트림에 \"다시 더하기\" 때문에, 스트림의 스케일은 층이 깊어질수록 계속 커집니다 (100, 100.5, ...).\n    * 입력이 크면 Q x K^T가 매우 커져 softmax가 포화되고 (출력이 0 또는 1에 가까워짐), 기울기가 거의 0이 되어 학습이 불안정해집니다 (기울기 폭발 / 소실).\n    * RMSNorm은 스트림의 \"복사본\"을 표준 스케일로 되돌리므로, 어텐션은 항상 안전한 입력을 받고 출력도 작고 안정적입니다.\n    * 정규화되는 것은 복사본뿐이고 잔차 스트림 자체는 그대로입니다. 기울기가 \"+\"를 통해 앞쪽 층까지 곧바로 전달됩니다 (원래 Transformer의 post-norm과 달리 Pre-norm은 불안정한 warm-up이 필요 없음).\n    * RMSNorm은 LayerNorm의 평균 빼기를 생략합니다: 안정성은 같고 계산은 더 가볍습니다.","part_001":"멀티헤드 어텐션 (Multi-Head Attention)","part_002":"Q K V 투영과 RoPE","part_003":"의미 생성","part_004":"기하학적 회전","part_005":"내적","part_006":"피드포워드 네트워크 (Feed-Forward Network)","part_007":"LM Head (출력층)","act_004":"원시 K 행렬 = X x W_K","act_005":"원시 Q 행렬 = X x W_Q","act_007":"최종 Q_cat = 원시 Q_cat x R_position 0","act_008":"최종 K_cat = 원시 K_cat x R_position 0","act_009":"최종 Q_on = 원시 Q_on x R_position 1","act_010":"최종 K_on = 원시 K_on x R_position 1","act_012":"원시 점수 cat = [q_cat x k_cat, q_cat x k_on, q_cat x k_desk]","act_013":"원시 점수 on = [q_on x k_cat, q_on x k_on, q_on x k_desk]","act_014":"원시 점수 desk = [q_desk x k_cat, q_desk x k_on, q_desk x k_desk]","note_003":"          선형 투영 (행렬 곱셈): X x W_Q, X x W_K, X x W_V (아래 예시 값은 가정).\n          Q (Query) = 토큰이 찾는 것. K (Key) = 토큰이 내놓는 라벨.\n          V (Value) = 선택되었을 때 전달하는 내용.\n          Q와 K는 \"누구 말을 들을지\", V는 \"무엇을 가져올지\"를 정합니다.\n          예제 설정 (아래에서 쓰는 용어):\n          |= 용어 |= 뜻 |= 예제 (head 1 표시) |= Llama 3 8B |\n          | d_model | 토큰 하나의 벡터 길이 | 4 | 4096 |\n          | n_heads | 병렬 어텐션 head 수 (각자 자신의 W_Q, W_K, W_V를 가짐; Z는 이어 붙여 d_model로 돌아감) | 2 (head 1만 계산; head 2는 그리기만 하고 계산하지 않음) | 32 |\n          | d_k = d_head = d_model / n_heads | head마다 Q, K, V 한 행의 길이 | 4 / 2 = 2 (V 행도 같음: d_v = d_k) | 4096 / 32 = 128 |","note_004":"          지금 원시 Q와 K 행렬에는 의미 정보만 있을 뿐,\n          순서라는 개념이 아직 없습니다. 바로 이 순간 RoPE\n          (회전 위치 임베딩, Rotary Position Embedding)가 등장해 생성을 마무리합니다.\n          RoPE는 Q와 K만 회전시킵니다 (V는 절대 회전시키지 않습니다).\n          이 예제의 단순화한 회전 (d_k = 2이므로 차원 쌍은 하나): (0, 1)이 위치마다 90° 돕니다.\n          90°: [a, b] -> [-b, a]. 180°: [a, b] -> [-a, -b].\n          (실제 RoPE는 head 안의 모든 차원 쌍을 각자의 주파수로 회전시킵니다.)\n          최종 K와 V는 KV 캐시에 추가되므로, Decode 중에는\n          새 토큰의 Q, K, V만 계산합니다.","note_005":"        목적: 각 토큰의 Key가 현재 토큰의 Query와 얼마나 관련 있는지 채점 (\"토큰 i가 j를 얼마나 봐야 하나?\").\n        내적 q x k: 원소별로 곱한 뒤 모두 더합니다 (계산은 위의 \"원시 점수\" 상자).\n        큼 = 방향이 비슷함 (key가 query와 맞음), 0에 가까움 = 무관.\n        GPU는 모든 쌍을 한꺼번에 채점합니다, Q x K^T: [3, 2] x [2, 3] = 3 × 3 표 (i행 j열),\n        각 칸 = 곱셈-덧셈 2번 (d_k = 2). 아직 가중치가 아닌 원시 점수입니다:\n        [4.0, 3.0, -1.0]  <- 원시 점수 cat\n        [3.0, 1.0, 0.0]  <- 원시 점수 on\n        [2.0, 4.0, -2.0]  <- 원시 점수 desk\n        \"cat\"은 자기 자신에 대한 점수가 가장 높고, \"on\"은 \"cat\"과 가장 잘 맞고,\n        \"desk\"는 \"on\"과 가장 잘 맞으며 \"cat\"과도 맞습니다.\n\n        Decode 중에는 마지막 행만 계산합니다: 새 토큰의 query를\n        캐시된 모든 key와 곱합니다 (1 x seq_len 개의 점수).","act_015":"스케일링 (sqrt d_k로 나눔)","note_006":"      숫자가 폭주해서 Softmax 층이 구분하지 못하게 되는 것을 막기 위해, 표 전체를 sqrt d_k로 나눕니다.\n      이유: 각 점수는 d_k개 곱의 합이라 d_k와 함께 커집니다. sqrt d_k로 나누면 크기가 안정됩니다.\n      여기서는 d_k = 2 (Q 또는 K 한 행의 길이. 선형 투영 노트의 표 참조)이므로 sqrt d_k = sqrt 2 = 1.41입니다.\n      GPU는 행렬의 모든 칸을 1.41로 나눕니다.\n\n      [4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, 3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, -1.0 / 1.41 = -0.71]\n      [3.0 / 1.41 = 2.12, 1.0 / 1.41 = 0.71, 0.0 / 1.41 = 0.0]\n      [2.0 / 1.41 = 1.41, 4.0 / 1.41 = 2.83, -2.0 / 1.41 = -1.41]","act_016":"인과 마스크 (필터 규칙)","note_007":"      바로 이 하위 단계에서 인과 마스크가 작동합니다.\n      시스템은 Query(행)의 위치 ID를\n      Key(열)의 위치 ID와 비교합니다.\n      규칙: Key 위치 > Query 위치이면\n      미래 토큰입니다. 점수를 음의 무한대 (-∞)로 바꿉니다.\n\n      [2.83, -∞, -∞]\n      [2.12, 0.71, -∞]\n      [1.41, 2.83, -1.41]","act_017":"Softmax 증폭 (백분율 생성)","note_008":"      이 마스크된 표를 Softmax에 넣으면,\n      각 행이 아름답게 처리됩니다: 0행 (\"cat\"): e^-∞ = 0이므로,\n      미래 칸의 가중치는 정확히 0%입니다. \"cat\"은 100% 자기 자신만 봅니다.\n      1행 (\"on\"): \"desk\"의 미래 칸은 0%. 남은 점수 (2.12와 0.71)가 경쟁하여\n      결과는 cat 약 80%, on 약 20% (e^2.12 = 8.33, e^0.71 = 2.03, 8.33 / 10.37 = 0.80).\n      2행 (\"desk\"): 가려진 값이 없습니다.\n      스케일링된 점수 (1.41, 2.83, -1.41)가 공개적으로 경쟁하여 결과는\n      cat 약 19%, on 약 80%, desk 약 1% (e^1.41 = 4.10, e^2.83 = 16.95, e^-1.41 = 0.24를 그 합 21.29로 나눔).","act_018":"어텐션 맵 행렬","act_019":"Value 행렬 곱셈 (섞기)","note_010":"      이 단계에서 모델은 어텐션 맵 행렬에 Value 행렬 (V)을 곱합니다.\n      여기가 토큰들이 실제로 정보를 주고받는 곳입니다: 각 토큰의 출력 Z는 주목하는 토큰들의 Value 벡터의 가중합입니다 (예: \"on\" = cat의 V의 80% + 자기 V의 20%).\n\n      컨텍스트 행렬 (Z)=Attention_Map x V\n\n      수학적으로 확인해 보기 위해, head 1을 계산하고, 각 단어의 Value 벡터가 d_head = 2개의 숫자, 즉 Q, K와 같은 길이라고 가정합니다 (Llama 3 같은 실제 모델에서 d_head는 보통 헤드당 128개의 숫자입니다).\n      Value 벡터에 그럴듯한 의미 숫자를 할당해 봅니다:\n      V_cat = [2.0, -1.0]\n      V_on = [0.0, 3.0]\n      V_desk = [5.0, 1.0]\n\n      GPU는 어텐션 맵 각 행의 가중치를 Value의 각 열에 곱합니다.\n      이것은 각 행에 대해 동시에 병렬로 수행되는 표준 가중합입니다:","note_014":"      컨텍스트 행렬 (Z) = [\n        Slot 0: [2.0, -1.0]    (\"cat\"의 컨텍스트 벡터)\n        Slot 1: [1.6, -0.2]    (\"on\"의 컨텍스트 벡터)\n        Slot 2: [0.43, 2.22]  (\"desk\"의 컨텍스트 벡터)\n      ]","act_023":"헤드 2의 어텐션","note_015":"    선형 투영\n    병렬로 동작한 모든 어텐션 헤드를 섞어 줍니다\n    * 학습 가능한 파라미터(가중치)로 이루어진, 학습되는 투영 층\n    * 벡터 안의 숫자를 바꿔서\n    서로 다른 헤드의 컨텍스트를 섞습니다.\n    * 행렬 곱셈 (×)\n    1. W_O 이전 (흩어진 통찰): N개(예제는 2개, Llama 3 8B는 32개)의 헤드가 각각\n      다른 논리적 각도에서 문장을 봅니다.\n      * 헤드 1은 문법 구조를 나타내는 작은 벡터를 출력합니다.\n      * 헤드 2는 동물의 특성을 나타내는 작은 벡터를 출력합니다.\n\n    2. 연결 단계: 모델은 이 N개의 개별 벡터를 나란히 붙여\n      아주 넓은 벡터 하나를 만듭니다. 이 순간에는\n      값이 아직 원시적이고 서로 분리된 정보일 뿐, 섞이지 않았습니다.\n\n    3. W_O 곱셈 (×): 이 넓은 벡터에 W_O 행렬을 곱합니다.\n\n    \"on\"의 예시 (위의 단계별 계산은 헤드 1. 헤드 2와 W_O는 가정한 값):\n    Output = Concat_Z x W_O   ([3, 4] x [4, 4] -> [3, 4], W_O assumed; real: [d_model, d_model])\n    Head 1 Z_on = [1.6, -0.2]   Head 2 Z_on = [1.0, 0.5]\n    Concatenated = [1.6, -0.2, 1.0, 0.5]   (2 + 2 = d_model = 4)\n    Column 0 of W_O = [0.5, -0.2, 0.4, 1.0]\n    Output[0] = 1.6x0.5 + (-0.2)x(-0.2) + 1.0x0.4 + 0.5x1.0\n              = 0.8 + 0.04 + 0.4 + 0.5 = 1.74\n    헤드 1이 0.84 + 헤드 2가 0.9: 숫자 하나에 두 헤드가 섞여 있습니다.\n    4개 열 모두: \"on\"의 어텐션 출력 = [1.74, -0.6, 0.17, 0.78]","act_026":"잔차 연결 (Residual Connection)","act_040":"잔차 연결 (Residual Connection)","note_016":"    그 층의 입력(pre-attention RMSNorm 전에 보관한 잔차 스트림)을\n    어텐션 출력에 더해 정보 손실을 막습니다\n\n    1번째 층의 \"on\" toy 예시 (값은 모두 위의 것):\n    층 입력 (embedding_on)      = [-0.688, -0.688, -0.884, 0.732]\n    \"on\"의 어텐션 출력          = [1.74, -0.6, 0.17, 0.78]\n    합 (원소별)                 = [1.052, -1.288, -0.714, 1.512]\n    원래 embedding이 합에 남아 있음: 층은 변화량만 배우면 됩니다.","act_027":"RMSNorm (FFN 앞)","note_017":"    Pre-norm: FFN \"앞에서\" 정규화합니다. 정규화하지 않은 스트림\n    (위의 잔차 덧셈 이후)은 다음 잔차 덧셈을 위해 따로 보관합니다.\n\n    이것은 두 번째의 독립된 RMSNorm입니다 (공식은 같고 gamma는 별도).\n    * 입력은 x1 = x0 + 어텐션 출력, 즉 위 잔차 덧셈의 결과입니다.\n      이 덧셈으로 스트림의 스케일이 다시 커졌습니다.\n    * FFN의 SwiGLU 활성화는 입력 스케일에 민감하므로,\n      FFN에 들어가기 전에 x1의 복사본을 정규화합니다.","note_018":"        목적: attention은 토큰 사이에 정보를 옮기고,\n        FFN은 각 토큰의 벡터를 따로 처리합니다\n        (비선형성 추가).\n        방법: 넓히고 (gate, up), SiLU 게이트로 거르고,\n        up과 곱한 뒤 W_down으로 d_model로 줄입니다.","act_028":"들어오는 토큰 벡터","note_019":"        모델은 토큰 벡터\n        (예: 크기 4,096)를 두 개의 별도 가중치 행렬에 곱해\n        훨씬 큰 은닉 차원으로 투영합니다.\n        보통 약 2.7~3.5배 넓습니다\n        (예: Llama 3 8B는 4,096에서 14,336개로 늘어 3.5배.\n        작은 모델은 8/3 = 2.67배를 쓰기도 합니다).","act_030":"벡터 A (적용 전)","act_031":"활성화 함수 (Activation function)","note_020":"            SiLU(x) = x · sigmoid(x) (Llama 같은 SwiGLU. 일부 모델은 대신 GELU)\n            * 큰 음수 -> 0에 가까워짐 (거의 꺼짐)\n            * 큰 양수 -> 거의 그대로 통과 (켜짐)","act_032":"벡터 A (적용 후)","act_034":"벡터 B","act_035":"결합","note_021":"        원소별 곱셈\n        [ 12.5, -0.072, 0.110 ]\n        (활성화된 벡터 A / 필터)\n        × [ 5.0,  9.0, -2.0  ]\n        (원시 벡터 B / 지식 데이터)\n        ---\n        = [ 62.5, -0.65, -0.22 ]\n        (결합된 넓은 벡터)\n","note_022":"        다운 투영 행렬;\n        원래의 모델 차원\n        (예: 4,096)으로 다시 줄입니다","act_037":"임베딩 2의 FFN","act_038":"임베딩 N의 FFN","act_039":"행렬 조립","note_023":"    위치 순서대로 쌓기\n    * GPU 메모리가 처리하는 데이터 정리 단계.\n    * 벡터의 물리적 배치를 바꿔서\n      행 단위로 쌓아 행렬 블록으로 만듭니다.\n    * 연결 / 쌓기 (수학 연산 없음, 데이터 블록을 옮기기만 함).","note_024":"    pre-FFN RMSNorm 전에 보관한 스트림을 FFN 출력에 더합니다.\n    이 합이 다음 층의 입력입니다.","act_041":"마지막 RMSNorm","note_025":"  마지막 층 뒤, LM Head 앞에서 RMSNorm을 한 번 더 적용합니다.\n  스트림에는 N개 층의 덧셈이 쌓였으므로, 여기서 스케일을 다시 맞춰\n  logits가 적절한 크기가 되게 합니다 (자체 gamma).","act_042":"슬라이싱 (Slicing)","note_026":"행렬 슬라이싱 연산 (또는 인덱스 선택)으로\n시퀀스의 맨 마지막 벡터만 가져옵니다\n(추론 전용: 다음 토큰 예측에는 마지막 위치만 필요합니다).\n학습에서는 \"모든\" 위치의 벡터를 유지하고 각 위치에서 loss를 계산합니다\n(정답은 입력을 한 토큰 밀어 놓은 것입니다).","note_027":"W_vocab이라는 거대한 가중치 행렬을 써서\n벡터를\n단어 점수로 되돌립니다.","note_028":"언임베딩 층\n* 표의 크기: W_vocab 행렬의 모양은 [Model_Dimension, Vocabulary_Size]입니다.\n모델의 벡터 크기가 4,096이고 사전에 128,000개의 단어(토큰)가 있다면,\n이 행렬은 숫자로 이루어진 거대한 표가 됩니다.\n\n* 로짓 출력: 최종 벡터 (크기 4,096)에 이 W_vocab 행렬을 곱합니다.\n이 연산은 최종 벡터를 모델 어휘의 모든 단어와 동시에 비교하여\n로짓이라고 부르는 128,000개의 원시 숫자 목록을 출력합니다.\n예시: h x W_vocab -> logits = [0.50, -0.15, 1.25, 3.00, -0.70]\n(cat, on, desk, water, the)","act_044":"Temperature와 Top-K","act_046":"Top-P와 샘플링 선택","act_047":"입력 토큰 (프롬프트 + 지금까지 생성한 것)","note_029":"로짓에 적용 (Softmax 전):\n* 로짓을 Temperature로 나눕니다 (0 = greedy, 그냥 argmax를 취함).\n* Top-K는 가장 높은 K개의 로짓만 남기고 나머지는 -inf로 둡니다.\n예시 (T = 1.0, K = 3): logits / 1.0 = 그대로, water 3.00, desk 1.25, cat 0.50 유지, on과 the는 -inf","note_030":"확률에 적용 (Softmax 후):\n* Top-P (nucleus): 확률이 큰 순서로 합이 P에 이를 때까지 더하고, 그 토큰들만 남기고 나머지는 버립니다. 남긴 확률을 합이 1이 되도록 재정규화한 뒤 무작위로 하나를 뽑습니다.\n예시, Softmax 출력: water 0.796, desk 0.138, cat 0.065 (e^x = 20.09, 3.49, 1.65; 합 25.22)\n  P = 0.9: water 0.796, 이어서 + desk = 0.934 >= 0.9, 중단; cat은 제외; 재정규화: water 0.852, desk 0.148 (각각 / 0.934). 샘플링: 85% \"water\"; \"water\"가 뽑혔다고 가정","note_031":"모델이 계속 써야 한다면 (아니오), 방금 생성한 단어 (\"water\")를 가지고\nEmbedding 단계로 되돌아갑니다. 새 토큰만 처리하고 (Decode), 앞선\n토큰은 다시 계산하지 않고 KV 캐시에서 가져옵니다.","legend_001":"색","legend_002":"의미","legend_003":"입력: 토큰, 임베딩","legend_004":"RMSNorm (pre-norm)","legend_005":"어텐션: Q/K/V, RoPE, 점수, 마스크, softmax, 혼합, W_O","legend_006":"잔차 연결 (보관한 스트림을 다시 더함)","legend_007":"피드포워드 네트워크 (SwiGLU)","legend_008":"LM head, 샘플링","legend_009":"fork = 병렬로 실행되는 단계.","note_032":"    반복 한 번 = 한 층 = 트랜스포머 블록 하나 (N개 층, 예: Llama 3 8B는 32층).\n    각 층은 자신만의 가중치를 가집니다 (층끼리 공유하지 않음).\n    한 층의 가중치 (Llama 3 8B, d_model = 4096): 학습으로 얻고, 생성할 때는 고정입니다.\n\n    |= 위치 |= 가중치 |= 형태 |\n    | 어텐션 앞의 RMSNorm | gamma | 4096 |\n    | 어텐션 (Attention) | W_Q | 4096 x 4096 |\n    |  | W_K | 4096 x 1024 |\n    |  | W_V | 4096 x 1024 |\n    |  | W_O | 4096 x 4096 |\n    | FFN 앞의 RMSNorm | gamma | 4096 |\n    | FFN (SwiGLU) | W_gate | 4096 x 14336 |\n    |  | W_up | 4096 x 14336 |\n    |  | W_down | 14336 x 4096 |\n    층당 약 2.18억 파라미터 x 32층 = 70억 (+ embedding과 LM head 10억 = 총 80억).","note_033":"반복 시작점: 반복은 여기로 돌아옵니다.\n1회차: 입력 = 프롬프트. 이후: 입력 + 직전에 샘플링한 토큰.\nEOS 또는 최대 길이에 도달할 때까지 반복합니다 (판단은 맨 아래).","note_034":"[1, 2] x R_position 0\n-> [1, 2]  (0°: 변화 없음)","note_035":"[2, 1] x R_position 0\n-> [2, 1]  (0°: 변화 없음)","note_038":"desk, 위치 2 (180°):\nQ: [0, -2] -> [0, 2]\nK: [-1, 1] -> [1, -1]","note_042":"예시 (d_model = 4, 어휘 5개 단어)\n최종 벡터 h = [0.5, -1.0, 1.0, 2.0]\nW_vocab은 [4, 5], 단어마다 한 열:\n  cat   = [ 0.2,  0.1, -0.3,  0.4]\n  on    = [-0.5,  0.3,  0.2,  0.1]\n  desk  = [ 0.1, -0.2,  0.4,  0.3]\n  water = [ 0.6, -0.4,  0.5,  0.9]\n  the   = [ 0.0,  0.2, -0.1, -0.2]\n로짓 = h와 열의 내적. \"water\"의 경우:\n  water = 0.30 + 0.40 + 0.50 + 1.80 = 3.00\n(다른 열도 같은 방식)\nlogits = [0.50, -0.15, 1.25, 3.00, -0.70]\n\"water\"의 점수가 가장 높습니다.","act_025":"선형 투영 (W_O)","note_043":"    \"Llama 스타일\" = Meta Llama의 decoder-only Transformer 개선 (핵심은 GPT와 동일, GPT-1은 2018년); 지금은 많은 오픈 모델도 사용.\n    |= 부분 |= 원래 Transformer (2017) / GPT-2 (2019) |= Llama 스타일 (Meta: Llama 1 2023년 2월, Llama 2 2023년 7월, Llama 3 2024년 4월) |\n    | 정규화 | LayerNorm; post-norm (2017), pre-norm (GPT-2) | RMSNorm (2019), pre-norm |\n    | 위치 정보 | 절대 위치 임베딩을 입력에 더함 | RoPE (2021): Q와 K를 회전 |\n    | FFN, 편향 | 행렬 2개 + ReLU / GELU, 편향 있음 | SwiGLU (2020): gate, up, down; 편향 없음 |\n    | K / V 헤드 수 | Multi-head: K/V 수 = Q 수 | GQA (2023): K/V 헤드가 적음 (Llama 2 70B, 3; 그리지 않음) |","act_043":"선형 투영 (W_vocab)"}}
